cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ABAA Smart Controller"
message: "If you use this software or the measurement data, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Oukhanov
    given-names: Daniel
    alias: doukhanov
repository-code: "https://github.com/doukhanov/abaa-controller"
abstract: >-
  Instrument control, data management and cooldown-endpoint prediction for
  alternating-bias assisted annealing (ABAA) of Al/AlOx/Al Josephson junctions,
  used for room-temperature trimming of transmon qubit frequency. Validated on
  Manhattan-style transmon junctions and SQUIDs over a 6 +/- 3 kOhm working
  range, reaching +/- 50 Ohm targeting precision (approximately +/- 25 MHz
  frequency equivalent at 6 GHz). Measurement data is not distributed.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - superconducting qubits
  - Josephson junction
  - transmon
  - frequency targeting
  - laboratory automation
